<title>FRANCE: BHV 1996 net attrib profit rises.</title>
<headline>BHV 1996 net attrib profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attrib				   56.5   vs	   48.5</p>
<p>    Net dividend  (francs)		   16     vs	   16</p>
<p>    Net					    56.6   vs	   48.6</p>
<p>    Operating				   100.3   vs	   65.7</p>
<p>    Exceptionals		  loss	  2.4   vs   gain  10.0</p>
<p>    Operating				    50.6   vs	    0.2</p>
<p>    Cashflow				    131.6   vs	  139</p>
<p>    Sales of goods ex tax  (billion)	3.41  vs	    3.40</p>
<p>Note - Retailer BHV said that the swing in the exceptional results reflected capital gains in 1995 sale of leasing rights to Musicway.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
